    "source": "protection_system",
    "first_line": 196,
    "last_line": 216,
    "applicable": "S4 invokes the standing traffic rules. General outflow tracing is a conservative contamination/hazard condition here.",
    "not_transferred": "S1\u2013S3/S5\u2013S6 describe the planetary protection architecture, duration and atmospheric tradeoff. The S7 escape-region/R1 numerical budget is not a numerical threshold for this enclosed phase; its allocated share remains open."
  },
  "rules": [
    "No new extraction fractions, preserved percentages, buffers, legal permissions or approved mine locations are created.",
    "Unknown evidence is unresolved, not a failure or an attested pass. An explicit failed condition or hold blocks release.",
    "Even all passed attestations report conditions_satisfied, never extraction authorization; this tool checks recorded evidence status and completeness, not its empirical truth or legal sufficiency.",
    "Project principles with proposed origins are applied as conservative study conditions with that status preserved.",
    "The same retained named-science holds apply before every union or broad-minus-narrow set operation. Removing a source from a narrow set never releases it into a broad remainder.",
    "Sealed/native sample condition, unopened retention, multiple locations, institutional continuity, provenance, review and access remain separate gates.",
    "All current catalogue candidates lack these site-specific attestations and therefore remain unresolved or held. A hypothetical mass allowance and a cash provision cannot satisfy the gates."
  ],
